{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0277","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0277:00000106:text","row":37664,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"昼。","en":"Noon.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902399","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4018:00001","en":"Noon.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0277:00000122:text","row":37665,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴と別れて、一人で昼飯。","en":"After Tomoki left, I ate lunch alone.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902400","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4018:00002","en":"I part with Tomoki and lunch alone,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0277:00000154:text","row":37666,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"人気のない食堂。","en":"The cafeteria was deserted.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902401","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4018:00003","en":"in a cafeteria deserted of people.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0277:0000017c:text","row":37667,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"持ってきた食パンにジャムを塗って、機械的に胃袋に放り込んだ。","en":"I spread jam on the sliced bread I'd brought and mechanically tossed it into my stomach.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902402","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4018:00004","en":"I spread jam on the Pain de Mie that I had brought with, and mechanically toss it into the stomach.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0277:000001d8:text","row":37668,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「……貧しい食生活だ」","en":"“...What a sad excuse for a diet.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902403","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4018:00005","en":"Taichi: \"...a poor man's eating habits these.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0277:0000020e:text","row":37669,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「ん？」","en":"“Hm?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902404","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4018:00006","en":"Taichi: \"Hm?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0277:0000022e:text","row":37670,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"背後に視線を向ける。","en":"I glanced behind me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902405","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4018:00007","en":"I turn my sight towards my back.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0277:0000025a:text","row":37671,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"誰もいない。","en":"No one there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902406","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4018:00008","en":"There is no one.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0277:0000027e:text","row":37672,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"気のせいか。","en":"My imagination?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902407","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4018:00009","en":"Just my imagination?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0277:000002a2:text","row":37673,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"見られている気がしたが。","en":"And yet I'd felt someone watching me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902408","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4018:00010","en":"But I had the feeling that I was being watched.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
